  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카나리 컬트 퀴즈왕을\n이런 곳에서 뵙는군요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B098B9AC0020CEECD2B80020D034C988C655C744000AC774B7F00020ACF3C5D0C11C0020BD59B294AD70C694002E00100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "퀴즈왕이라면 아시겠지만,\n카나리 님의 파트너 하면 저리더프죠?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D034C988C655C774B77CBA740020C544C2DCACA0C9C0B9CC002C000ACE74B098B9AC0020B2D8C7580020D30CD2B8B1080020D558BA740020C800B9ACB354D504C8E0003F00100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저도 카나리 님과 같은 포켓몬을\n파트너로 삼고자 저리릴을 키우고 있어요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B3C40020CE74B098B9AC0020B2D8ACFC0020AC19C7400020D3ECCF13BAACC744000AD30CD2B8B108B85C0020C0BCACE0C7900020C800B9ACB9B4C7440020D0A4C6B0ACE00020C788C5B4C694002E00100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이제 최강의 저리릴에게 천둥의돌을 사용해\n저리더프로 만드는 일만 남았죠.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C81C0020CD5CAC15C7580020C800B9ACB9B4C5D0AC8C0020CC9CB465C758B3CCC7440020C0ACC6A9D574000AC800B9ACB354D504B85C0020B9CCB4DCB2940020C77CB9CC0020B0A8C558C8E0002E00100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런 타이밍에 퀴즈왕을 만나다니!\n이건 그야말로 기적이라구요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F00020D0C0C774BC0DC5D00020D034C988C655C7440020B9CCB098B2E4B2C80021000AC774AC740020ADF8C57CB9D0B85C0020AE30C801C774B77CAD6CC694002100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러니 저와 승부해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n이번 기회에 가장 강하고 가장 짜릿한\n저리릴을 골라내고 말겠어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECB2C80020C800C6400020C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC138C694002100100001BE01000AC774BC880020AE30D68CC5D00020AC00C7A50020AC15D558ACE00020AC00C7A50020C9DCB9BFD55C000AC800B9ACB9B4C7440020ACE8B77CB0B4ACE00020B9D0ACA0C5B4C694002100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부할 준비가 됐다면\n저에게 말을 걸어 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D5600020C900BE44AC000020B410B2E4BA74000AC800C5D0AC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저와 승부해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n이번 기회에 가장 강하고 가장 짜릿한\n저리릴을 골라내고 말겠어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C6400020C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC138C694002100100001BE01000AC774BC880020AE30D68CC5D00020AC00C7A50020AC15D558ACE00020AC00C7A50020C9DCB9BFD55C000AC800B9ACB9B4C7440020ACE8B77CB0B4ACE00020B9D0ACA0C5B4C694002100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "상대해 드릴게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C1B300D5740020B4DCB9B4AC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네! 그럼요!\n얼마든지 기다려 드리죠!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B12400210020ADF8B7FCC6940021000AC5BCB9C8B4E0C9C00020AE30B2E4B8240020B4DCB9ACC8E0002100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카나리 컬트 퀴즈왕에게 한 수 배우면서\n최강의 저리릴을 골라내고 말겠어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B098B9AC0020CEECD2B80020D034C988C655C5D0AC8C0020D55C0020C2180020BC30C6B0BA74C11C000ACD5CAC15C7580020C800B9ACB9B4C7440020ACE8B77CB0B4ACE00020B9D0ACA0C5B4C694002100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "배틀 존이 되어 버렸네요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n이번 포켓몬 승부는\n다음으로 미루죠!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC30D2C00020C874C7740020B418C5B40020BC84B838B124C694002100100001BE01000AC774BC880020D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B294000AB2E4C74CC73CB85C0020BBF8B8E8C8E0002100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "과연 카나리 컬트 퀴즈왕!\n포켓몬 배틀 실력도 일품이네요!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACFCC5F00020CE74B098B9AC0020CEECD2B80020D034C988C6550021000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020BC30D2C00020C2E4B825B3C40020C77CD488C774B124C6940021002100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "졌지만 천둥의돌을 사용할\n가장 강하고 가장 짜릿한<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n저리릴을 결정할 수 있었어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C84CC9C0B9CC0020CC9CB465C758B3CCC7440020C0ACC6A9D560000AAC00C7A50020AC15D558ACE00020AC00C7A50020C9DCB9BFD55C00100001BE00000AC800B9ACB9B4C7440020ACB0C815D5600020C2180020C788C5C8C5B4C694002100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "후후...\n아직 멀었군요, 기유!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D6C4D6C4002E002E002E000AC544C9C10020BA40C5C8AD70C694002C0020AE30C720002100100002011400350000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마니 나리!?\n제가 뭔가 틀린 건가요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8B2C80020B098B9AC0021003F000AC81CAC000020BB54AC000020D2C0B9B00020AC74AC00C694003F00100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리 카나리 님께서는 강한 저리릴을\n저리더프로 진화시키신 게 아니라...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9AC0020CE74B098B9AC0020B2D8AED8C11CB2940020AC15D55C0020C800B9ACB9B4C744000AC800B9ACB354D504B85C0020C9C4D654C2DCD0A4C2E00020AC8C0020C544B2C8B77C002E002E002E00100002011400350000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "약한 저리릴을\n최강의 저리더프로 단련시킨 겁니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C57DD55C0020C800B9ACB9B4C744000ACD5CAC15C7580020C800B9ACB354D504B85C0020B2E8B828C2DCD0A80020AC81B2C8B2E4002100100002011400350000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런 짜릿한 반전이...!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F00020C9DCB9BFD55C0020BC18C804C774002E002E002E0021002100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "리리리...!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9ACB9ACB9AC002E002E002E002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모든 저리릴을 귀여워하고 사랑해 줘야\n진정한 카친이라 할 수 있죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8B4E00020C800B9ACB9B4C7440020ADC0C5ECC6CCD558ACE00020C0ACB791D5740020C918C57C000AC9C4C815D55C0020CE74CE5CC774B77C0020D5600020C2180020C788C8E0002E00100002011400350000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기유를 상대해 주셔서 감사합니다!\n역시 이 몸의 전우입니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30C720B97C0020C0C1B300D5740020C8FCC154C11C0020AC10C0ACD569B2C8B2E40021000AC5EDC2DC0020C7740020BAB8C7580020C804C6B0C785B2C8B2E4002100100002011400350000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기유, ZZ4의 결속을 다지기 위해\n카친들과 함께 특훈을 하러 갑시다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30C720002C0020005A005A0034C7580020ACB0C18DC7440020B2E4C9C0AE300020C704D574000ACE74CE5CB4E4ACFC0020D568AED80020D2B9D6C8C7440020D558B7EC0020AC11C2DCB2E4002100100002011400350000",
